Pixoo Doodle is an independent integration for Divoom displays.

Protocol and device behavior references:
Divoom ShowDoc and DivoomDevelop/divoom-wifi-python
gickowtf/pixoo-homeassistant (endpoint fallback and drawing counter observations)
cyanheads/pixoo-toolkit (frame pacing, dimensions and firmware limits)
SimplyRoba/pixoo-bridge.rs (command inventory)

The client and integration are original implementations. Silkscreen Regular is
